    pr_ref:  # 57b8
    description: "Observed 2026-04-17 on PR #3110: auto-pr pushed, CI passed, fast-forward merge failed (branch behind base), local rebase + force-push succeeded, but the subsequent merge attempt was refused because CI needed to re-run on the rebased SHA. auto-pr emitted:\n\n    ⚠️  Merge not accepted after rebase (CI may need to re-run on new SHA)\n    Recovery: ./scripts/merge-pr 3110 --wait-for-ci\n    Recovery: ./scripts/merge-pr 3110\n\n…and exited 0.\n\nPer AGENTS.md 'Exit 0: Success — PR merged or vPR queued.' When the PR is neither merged nor queued, exit 0 lies to the caller. Should be exit 2 (timeout/slow) or exit 1 (failure) with the recovery hint unchanged.\n\nFix: in scripts/auto-pr, after the rebase+force-push merge retry, if the PR is still open, exit non-zero."  # 57b8
    fields: {}  # 57b8
